# =============================================================================
# Exceptions (Files to Include Despite Patterns Above)
# =============================================================================

# Include example .env template
!.env.example
!.env.template

# Include requirements files
!requirements*.txt

# Include sample data (if small)
!sample_data.csv

# Include README and documentation
!README.md
!QUICKSTART.md
!LICENSE
